flowchart TB
    A[AI Feature] --> B{Customer Visible?}
    B -- Yes --> C[Require Evidence and Safe Language]
    B -- No --> D[Internal Decision Support]

    C --> E{Can AI Commit Outcome?}
    D --> E

    E -- No --> F[Advisory Mode]
    E -- Bounded Action --> G[Assistive Mode]
    E -- Yes --> H[Automated Mode]

    F --> I[Human or Deterministic System Decides]
    G --> J[Policy, Thresholds, Audit, Fallback]
    H --> K[Low Risk Only, Rollback or Escalation Required]

    I --> L[Replay Record]
    J --> L
    K --> L

    L --> M[Prompt, Model Version, Evidence, Tool Calls, Output, Final Decision]
